# --- Optional live scrap-rate feed (Vijayawada market rates) ---
# There is no public licensed API for Indian scrap (kabadi) rates. Leave these unset to
# manage market rates manually in Admin > Live Rates & Margins. To go live, point this at a
# source you are licensed to use (data vendor, partner, or your own proxy). Expected JSON:
#   [{ "code": "COPPER", "name": "Copper", "category": "Metal", "ratePerKg": 563.81 }]
# (or { "items": [...] }). Synced hourly and on "Refresh live rates".
# MARKET_RATES_FEED_URL=
# MARKET_RATES_FEED_API_KEY=
# MARKET_RATES_FEED_KEY_HEADER=x-api-key


# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. PUSH NOTIFICATIONS (Firebase Cloud Messaging)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase console > Project settings > Service accounts > Generate new private key.
# Paste the whole JSON on one line, or base64-encode it. Leave unset to disable push
# (notifications still appear in the in-app inbox). Never commit the real value.
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
# ...or point at the key file instead:
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=C:/secrets/firebase-service-account.json
